With this plugin you can can specify a theme to display only for logged-in administrators. All other visitor see the default theme.

== Description ==

Choose a theme for logged-in admins only! This is a fully transparent method for all other visitors. This is a great way to work on a theme while visitors see the default theme.

[Developer Website](http://remicorson.com) - [Plugin's Page](http://remicorson.com/easy-admin-theme/)

== Installation ==

1. Upload the entire 'easy-admin-theme' folder to the '/wp-content/plugins/' directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Go to "Admin Theme" under 'Appearance' menu
4. Choose a theme among available themes

== Screenshots ==

1. Choose the theme to display to Admins

